cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "HILIC_3xTg_metabolome: analysis code for the 3xTg-AD hippocampal metabolomics figure"
abstract: >-
  R code reproducing Figure 6 of Mill et al., "A framework for robust targeted metabolomic profiling
  using chromatographic reproducibility and rational internal standards": protein-normalized and
  protein + PQN limma analysis of 92 HILIC-MS metabolites in 3xTg-AD vs C57BL/6J mouse hippocampus
  (genotype x sex x age), pathway enrichment, and the composite figure.
authors:
  - family-names: Mill
    given-names: Jericha
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1434-5459"
    affiliation: "University of Wisconsin–Madison"
  - family-names: Tu
    given-names: Andrew
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4958-8986"
    affiliation: "University of Wisconsin–Madison"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/andrewdtu/HILIC_3xTg_metabolome"
keywords:
  - metabolomics
  - HILIC-MS
  - 3xTg-AD
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - probabilistic quotient normalization
  - limma
